Scope note
----------

This MIT licence applies to:
  - The Python analysis code in `code/`
  - The reproducibility scripts (`run_all.sh`, `requirements.txt`)
  - The derived analysis outputs in `results/` (figures, tables, JSON summaries)
  - The LaTeX manuscript sources in `papers/` (the prose, methods, and tables
    authored by the project contributors).

It does NOT apply to:
  - Raw IHME Global Burden of Disease data (`data/ihme.csv`, `data/HAQ.CSV`,
    `data/SDI_1950_2021.csv`, `data/ihme_data/`). These data are subject to
    the IHME Free-of-Charge Non-commercial User Agreement; see
    https://www.healthdata.org/data-tools-practices/data-practices/ihme-free-charge-non-commercial-user-agreement
  - The WHO Treatment Outcomes data (`data/who_tb_outcomes.csv`), which is
    subject to WHO's data policy and terms; see
    https://www.who.int/teams/global-tuberculosis-programme/data
  - Country / province boundary shapefiles in `data/iran_shapefile/` and
    `data/ne_110m/`, which are subject to their respective Natural Earth and
    OpenStreetMap-derived licences.

All raw-data files listed above are excluded from this repository via
`.gitignore`. They must be obtained from the original sources by anyone
attempting to reproduce the analyses.
